  "details": "Whenever I reset my avatar or using fullbody tracking (before calibration) I sometimes turn onto a grey robot for a few seconds before suddenly changing back into my avatar. Whenever this happens, my fallback avatar gets reset back to the other public grey robot you usually start with at the beginning of vrchat instead of the fallback I choose. It's super annoying to have to keep fixing this by rechoosing my fallback every time I get that error (which happens basically every time I reset or right before I calibrate during fullbody tracking. I don't know if this is still happening but additionally resetting my avatar used to send me flying upwards onto the sky",
